{
  "id": 1464,
  "description": "### About\n\n- ***The Idle Bandits is a relaxed guild focused on steady progress over constant grinding. We value consistent participation and teamwork without putting pressure on our members. Play at your own pace, stay active when you can, and help the guild grow together.***\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### 🏆 OUR GOALS 🏆 \n\n- ***🥇 Have fun and make friends***\n\n- ***⚔️ Win Guild Challenges &amp; Assaults***\n\n- ***📈 Improve every season***\n\n- ***👑 Reach the top — and stay there***\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### ⚜️ WHAT WE EXPECT⚜️\n\n-  Consistency and a desire to have fun! if you&#039;re active, you&#039;re in! 🙌                                                     \n\n-  Progression-focused players\n\n-  Guild Challenge participation\n\n-  Full Assault preparation &amp; participation\n\n-  Teamwork, communication &amp; respect\n\n- No unnecessary drama\n\n- One character per person (Unless there is an event and we have free space)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### BENEFITS/SERVICES  (dm leaders)\n                    \n- Forging\n- Alchemy\n- Whatever you need really\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━                    \n### DISCORD \n- [***https://discord.gg/ewwM7bDusB***]\n- World Boss and Shrine Tier notifications \n- Giveaways\n- All the normal stuff guilds have in discord\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### RAIDS\n- ### Everyday schedule:\n- Combat level 40:    12:00PM CT\n- Combat level 60:    2:00PM CT\n- Combat level 70:    4:00PM CT\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### Top Contributor Recognition Program\n- ### (You must be in the guild discord to receive guild activity rewards)\n- *_The three highest-performing members, determined by guild contributions, deposits, and raid participation, will receive special rewards. Based on a market-value point system guild members will be rewarded points throughout the month on_* \n- 1000 gold = 1 point \n- 10000 gold = 10 points\n- Guild raid participation = 25 points \n    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n- 🥇 1 30-day membership pack  \n- 🥈 150k gold and 500 CGWS (Cooked Great White Shark)\n- 🥉 100k gold and 250 CGWS\n\n𝘋𝘪𝘴𝘤𝘭𝘢𝘪𝘮𝘦𝘳 : 𝘈𝘭𝘭 𝘪𝘯𝘧𝘰𝘳𝘮𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘰𝘯 𝘪𝘴 𝘴𝘶𝘣𝘫𝘦𝘤𝘵 𝘵𝘰 𝘤𝘩𝘢𝘯𝘨𝘦 𝘸𝘪𝘵𝘩𝘰𝘶𝘵 𝘱𝘳𝘪𝘰𝘳 𝘯𝘰𝘵𝘪𝘤𝘦.",
